{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.SchurWeylTrace"],"declarations":98,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.braidAlg_trace_W_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.braidAlg_trace_W_split","kind":"theorem","line":632,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorSchurWeyl.lean#L632-L643","doc":"**Schur–Weyl for the braid algebra, quantum-trace form.** For every `X` in the algebra\ngenerated by the strand braidings,\n`tr(W X) = Σ_{2j ≤ r} (Σ_{m=j}^{r−j} q^{2m}) · tr(X | W_{r,j})`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.braidAlg_trace_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.braidAlg_trace_split","kind":"theorem","line":621,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorSchurWeyl.lean#L621-L630","doc":"**Schur–Weyl for the braid algebra, weight-space form.** For every `X` in the algebra\ngenerated by the strand braidings, `tr(X | V_m) = Σ_{j ≤ min(m, r − m)} tr(X | W_{r,j})`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.trace_W_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.trace_W_split","kind":"theorem","line":600,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorSchurWeyl.lean#L600-L619","doc":"**The quantum trace over the standard modules**, for every weight-preserving `X`\ncommuting with `E` (`r = n + 1`, `[k]_q ≠ 0` for `1 ≤ k ≤ r`):\n`tr(W X) = Σ_{2j ≤ r} (Σ_{m=j}^{r−j} q^{2m}) · tr(X | W_{r,j})`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.braidAlg_comm_Em","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.braidAlg_comm_Em","kind":"theorem","line":595,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorSchurWeyl.lean#L595-L598","doc":"**Every element of the braid algebra commutes with `Em`.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.braidAlg_wp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.braidAlg_wp","kind":"theorem","line":590,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorSchurWeyl.lean#L590-L593","doc":"Every element of the braid algebra is weight-preserving. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.Gr.wp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.Gr.wp","kind":"theorem","line":586,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorSchurWeyl.lean#L586-L588","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.E_eq_Em","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.E_eq_Em","kind":"theorem","line":566,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorSchurWeyl.lean#L566-L582","doc":"**The coproduct raising operator is `Em`**: `E_{n+1} = Em_n` on `V^{⊗(n+1)}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.Em_snoc_snoc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.Em_snoc_snoc","kind":"theorem","line":545,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorSchurWeyl.lean#L545-L564","doc":"One step of the coproduct, entrywise: splitting off the last site of `Em`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.braidAlg_spec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.braidAlg_spec","kind":"theorem","line":527,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorSchurWeyl.lean#L527-L540","doc":"**Every element of the braid algebra commutes with `E` and `F` and preserves weight.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.braidAlg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.braidAlg","kind":"def","line":523,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorSchurWeyl.lean#L523-L525","doc":"The subalgebra of `End(V^{⊗(N+1)})` generated by the strand braidings. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.Gr.congr_deg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.Gr.congr_deg","kind":"theorem","line":518,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorSchurWeyl.lean#L518-L519","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.gr_S","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.gr_S","kind":"theorem","line":510,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/TensorSchurWeyl.lean#L510-L516","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.gr_F","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.TensorSchurWeyl.gr_F","kind":"theorem","line":506,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/li